This plugin runs inside the Omarchy shell and builds on its public plugin API
and UI components (qs.Ui: Panel, WidgetButton, KeyboardPanel,
PanelSectionHeader, PanelSeparator, PanelKeyCatcher; qs.Commons: Color,
Style). Those components are loaded from the user's Omarchy installation at
runtime and are not redistributed here. The panel layout (hero row, section
headers, meters, label/value pairs) follows the conventions of Omarchy's
first-party panels, notably omarchy.power.

  Omarchy - https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy
  Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson. MIT License.

No source code was copied from other community system-monitor plugins. These
MIT-licensed projects were studied for Omarchy plugin structure and idioms
(manifest layout, settings schema, helper-process patterns) and are
acknowledged with thanks:

  yassm                     https://github.com/jotenakis2/yassm
  io.github.arslan.sysmon   https://github.com/Mario-Mohar/io.github.arslan.sysmon
  omarchy-hwmon             https://github.com/baylander/omarchy-hwmon

Icons are Nerd Font glyphs rendered from the user's installed font (Omarchy
ships JetBrainsMono Nerd Font); no font files are included.
